Package: qcdd
Title: Build a Data Dictionary for Use with QAQC
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Russ", , "druss@mail.nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds concept lookup tables from Connect data dictionaries to
    support quality assurance and quality control workflows. Combines concept
    identifiers and definitions across dictionary columns, removes duplicate
    entries and records with missing identifiers, and reports conflicting
    definitions for review.
